  "label": "The dog is mapped as the speaker of the threatening text",
  "description": "The large, fluffy white dog is visually positioned as the entity that is speaking the threatening text. The dog's intense, confrontational gaze and central placement create a direct visual link to the text, implying that the dog is the 'I' in the statements 'i have 72 nukes aimed at israel' and 'if these damn j'ws don't stop pretending to be white i will wipe israel off the fucking map'. The visual material (the dog) is mapped onto the textual material (the threatening statements) to represent the speaker of the threat.",
